  "title": "2026-08-10 / 非凡大师",
  "summary": "by 新世界的大门",
  "content": "<p>今日休息。一觉睡到下午三四点，然后我去机厅，到了发现有11个人在排队打舞萌。我跳，拍国产拍拍机，打鼓。我发现一位非凡大师。</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://remnote-user-data.s3.amazonaws.com/fL4Tc9RBL2_GBlYyW4wLho4mCiN9sOQohVkhFIhSv5boT9_Se90L5DA0lL0GmEGLnF_cxgubd92-zFmlTLFaLOJUvcOziSmNllKK--Jsm0nY6Ee0_CRPWWHrj_UmdgnD.webp\" alt=\"非凡大师代言人\"><figcaption>非凡大师代言人</figcaption></figure>\n<p>和一位故人。让我们怀念他们。</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://remnote-user-data.s3.amazonaws.com/lqFvB0stNAY3QFu3EIy5BQ1fj-vrzShH4zIUWCdR8QMrD6-Qj8Q7ai8XN8Hy4SzdsOFoi0rSGax6-0JjRIEzH3m3wTW_o1ssrj9ei6HH5InaayffdvGcGJdTJGT-fGhl.webp\" alt=\"听见喀嚓的声音\"><figcaption>听见喀嚓的声音</figcaption></figure>",
